<section id="how-it-works" class="relative border-t border-slate-200/60 dark:border-neutral-800/80 bg-slate-50/40 dark:bg-transparent">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10 sm:mb-16">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-brand-orange tracking-wider uppercase">HOW IT WORKS</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mt-2.5 sm:mt-3 font-brand-hero leading-tight">
        Authentication in three clear steps
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 sm:mt-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed px-2">
        Built on battle-tested
        <span class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">OAuth 2.0</span>
        and
        <span class="font-semibold text-slate-800 dark:text-slate-200">OIDC (OpenID Connect)</span>
        standards — Pramaan handles authentication and identity, so your app can focus on building your product.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 sm:gap-8">
      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/95 dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-neutral-700 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-orange-50 dark:bg-brand-orange/15 text-brand-orange border border-orange-200/50 dark:border-brand-orange/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-brand-orange group-hover:text-white group-hover:border-transparent transition-all duration-300">01</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2.5 sm:mb-3">OAuth 2.0 Authorize</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Redirect users via PKCE-enabled OAuth 2.0 authorization. Pramaan securely validates user credentials, executes multi-factor authentication, and requests user consent.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/95 dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-neutral-700 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-sky-50 dark:bg-sky-500/15 text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-400 border border-sky-200/50 dark:border-sky-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-sky-500 group-hover:text-white group-hover:border-transparent transition-all duration-300">02</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2.5 sm:mb-3">Token Exchange</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Your backend securely exchanges the authorization code for an OAuth 2.0 access token and an OIDC ID token via the RFC-compliant token endpoint.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white/95 dark:bg-[#0a0a0a]/95 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-200/80 dark:border-neutral-800 hover:border-slate-300 dark:hover:border-neutral-700 transition-all duration-300 group">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 border border-emerald-200/50 dark:border-emerald-500/20 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg mb-5 sm:mb-6 group-hover:bg-emerald-500 group-hover:text-white group-hover:border-transparent transition-all duration-300">03</div>
        <h3 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2.5 sm:mb-3">OIDC Verification</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Verify token signatures offline using standard OIDC JWKS public keys, and query protected OIDC UserInfo endpoints using short-lived tokens.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
